{{!
    @template mod_redaction/editor_field

    Text area the preferred editor attaches to, with its format and draft area.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id - Id of the text area, the one given to use_editor()
    * name - Name of the editor field (its parts are name[text], name[format], name[itemid])
    * rows - Number of rows
    * text - Current text
    * format - Text format
    * itemid - Draft item id

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": "contenu_editor_text",
        "name": "contenu_editor",
        "rows": 20,
        "text": "<p>Texte</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "itemid": 0
    }
}}
<textarea id="{{id}}" name="{{name}}[text]" rows="{{rows}}" class="mod_redaction-textarea-full">{{text}}</textarea>
<input type="hidden" name="{{name}}[format]" value="{{format}}">
<input type="hidden" name="{{name}}[itemid]" value="{{itemid}}">
